# Test: ze config set/deactivate reload flag surface after the opt-in flip
# VALIDATES: spec-config-require-reload AC-1,3,4,6 -- editing a stored config
#            works with no flag (default no-notify), and the old --no-reload flag
#            is rejected (exit 2) on both `set` and `deactivate`.
# // test-relax: this .ci asserts only the exit code for the --no-reload
#   rejections, not the stderr text, and does not exercise `set --reload` at all.
#   Two reasons: (1) `set --reload` reads the shared credential store and contacts
#   the daemon, which is not isolated across the parallel suite; (2) the flag
#   error text reaches stderr via flag.ExitOnError + os.Exit, whose capture is
#   racy under the parallel harness (exit-code capture is reliable, so it stays).
#   The full --reload NOTIFY behaviour (default 0, --reload 1, stdin 0) and the
#   rejection are covered deterministically by TestReloadOptInGate and the flag
#   surface in internal/component/config/cli/reload_notify_test.go.
# PREVENTS: a regression that re-introduces --no-reload (would exit 0, failing
#           seq 2/3) or breaks the default no-daemon-contact set path.
tmpfs=test.conf:terminator=EOF_CONF
bgp {
	router-id 10.0.0.1
	session {
		asn {
			local 65533
		}
	}
}
EOF_CONF

option=env:var=ze.storage.blob:value=false

# Default (no flag): writes the value without contacting a daemon.
cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=ze config set test.conf bgp session asn local 65000:exit=0
expect=exit:code=0

# --no-reload is no longer defined on `set` (removed by the flip): unknown flag -> exit 2.
cmd=foreground:seq=2:exec=ze config set --no-reload test.conf bgp session asn local 65002:exit=2
expect=exit:code=2

# --no-reload is no longer defined on `deactivate` either: unknown flag -> exit 2.
cmd=foreground:seq=3:exec=ze config deactivate --no-reload test.conf bgp router-id:exit=2
expect=exit:code=2

# Only the default set (65000) persisted; the two rejected commands changed nothing.
cmd=foreground:seq=4:exec=ze config cat test.conf:exit=0
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stdout:contains=local 65000
